  "lapsed_date": "14/07/2017",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted ( Design and Access Statement, (PL)030 REV A, Existing side elevation, (PL)032, (PL)033, (PL)009 REV A, (PL)010 REV B, (PL)011 REV B, (PL)012 REV B, (PL)013 REV A, (PL)020 REV A, (PL)021 REV A, (PL)022, (PL)001, Flood Risk Assessment, Site Location Plan, (PL)300 REV C, (PL)302, (PL)102 REV D, (PL)103 REV D, (PL)099 REV E, (PL)100 REV E, (PL)101 REV E, (PL)200 REV B, (PL)201 REV C, (PL)202 REV C, (PL)203 REV C, (PL)204 REV A received on the 30.05.2014 ) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - No excavation or construction work shall be undertaken prior to the submission and approval in writing by the Local Planning Authority, of a Construction Method Statement, which is certified by a qualified professional, giving specific details of excavation, temporary works and construction techniques, including details of potential impacts on neighbouring land based on assessment of the geology and hydrology of the area.",
    "Condition : 5 - The basement extension at 4 and 6 Thornton Road shall at no time be used or occupied as a separate dwelling independent of the main house and shall not be used as sleeping accommodation.",
    "Condition : 6 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8:00am  to 6:00pm on Mondays to Friday and 9 :00am to 1:00pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - The development hereby permitted shall only be carried out in accordance with the approved Flood Risk Assessment produced and provided with the application (Reference 1578) and the basement shall not be occupied until all the measures in the Flood Risk Assessment are implemented."
  ],
